DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
21019::$$$message_0167_0000_0000$$$::The hymn doesn't skip a beat.[lr]::
21020::$$$message_0167_0000_0001$$$::Its performer's lips part just once, as if to greet her visitor.[lr]::
21021::$$$message_0167_0000_0002$$$::I sit down on the worn pew.[lr]::
21022::$$$message_0167_0000_0003$$$::Just before I depart...[lr]::
21023::$$$message_0167_0000_0004$$$::I close my eyes so that I do not sink into this love.::
21024::$$$message_0167_0001_0000$$$::The endless days I spent dreaming of who to hate.[lr]::
21025::$$$message_0167_0001_0001$$$::Endless, deep-seated hatred that never had a chance to choose anyone specific.::
21026::$$$message_0167_0002_0000$$$::The end of an artificially created malice.[lr]::
21027::$$$message_0167_0002_0001$$$::It failed to be the devil they all wished for. Instead, it became as a mirror to reflect humans.::
21028::$$$message_0167_0003_0000$$$::All the evil in the world is laughable.[lr]::
21029::$$$message_0167_0003_0001$$$::That describes humanity as a whole.[lr]::
21030::$$$message_0167_0003_0002$$$::Look in the mirror you made.[lr]::
21031::$$$message_0167_0003_0003$$$::Mankind created all of my sins.[lr]::
21032::$$$message_0167_0003_0004$$$::Rejoice, child of man. You have the ability to recreate all evil.::
21033::$$$message_0167_0004_0000$$$::What you feared was not evil, but your own weakness that gave rise to evil.[lr]::
21034::$$$message_0167_0004_0001$$$::Your pleasure in throwing stones.[lr]::
21035::$$$message_0167_0004_0002$$$::You dulled your senses, numbed your morals, and turned into something hideous.[lr]::
21036::$$$message_0167_0004_0003$$$::In this cruel world...[lr]::
21037::$$$message_0167_0004_0004$$$::We cannot live without hatred.::
21038::$$$message_0167_0005_0000$$$::Never will we find succor.[lr]::
21039::$$$message_0167_0005_0001$$$::We examine ourselves only to find a horde of bloodthirsty predators,[lr]::
21040::$$$message_0167_0005_0002$$$::sharpening our fangs and ripping apart all who enter.[lr]::
21041::$$$message_0167_0005_0003$$$::Like an aquarium of monstrous piranhas. No matter who you are, you only need to search yourself to find nauseating filth.[lr]::
21042::$$$message_0167_0005_0004$$$::And yet...[wt canskip=0]::
21043::$$$message_0167_0006_0000$$$::...Who could deny it?[lr]::
21044::$$$message_0167_0006_0001$$$::A filthy creature rebelled against its original function, only to suffer.[lr]::
21045::$$$message_0167_0006_0002$$$::Voiceless anguish. The contradiction of coexisting good and evil. Sparks flare and fade as the cog wheels grind.[lr]::
21046::$$$message_0167_0006_0003$$$::A small guide who follows an aimless, circling path in the darkness, without any guidepost of their own.::
21047::$$$message_0167_0007_0000$$$::                                          In this inky void…[lr]::
21048::$$$message_0167_0007_0001$$$::                                          I found that blindingly bright.::
21049::$$$message_0167_0008_0000$$$::What a radical misunderstanding. What a self-righteous utopia.[lr]::
21050::$$$message_0167_0008_0001$$$::What's ugly is ugly.[lr]::
21051::$$$message_0167_0008_0002$$$::Only humans can find some sentimental beauty in the hideous.[lr]::
21052::$$$message_0167_0008_0003$$$::And such sentiment is fleeting.[lr]::
21053::$$$message_0167_0008_0004$$$::But...::
21054::$$$message_0167_0009_0000$$$::I was fine with that.[lr]::
21055::$$$message_0167_0009_0001$$$::I only need a moment of brilliance.[lr]::
21056::$$$message_0167_0009_0002$$$::Within this infinite, everlasting evil,[lr]::
21057::$$$message_0167_0009_0003$$$::it was something coherent and bright, even if it was just hollow sentiment.::
21058::$$$message_0167_0010_0000$$$::That's right...[lr]::
21059::$$$message_0167_0010_0001$$$::Just as some say that the concept of a star was meant to guide all of mankind,[lr]::
21060::$$$message_0167_0010_0002$$$::I'll always be gazing, always be reaching for a brilliance that I'll never be able to grasp.::
21061::$$$message_0167_0011_0000$$$::In that case...[lr]::
21062::$$$message_0167_0011_0001$$$::I'd like to do something human, while I'm still human.[lr]::
21063::$$$message_0167_0011_0002$$$::I didn't leave anything behind.[lr]::
21064::$$$message_0167_0011_0003$$$::This dishonest nothingness saved no one. Let it have some meaning.::
21065::$$$message_0167_0012_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...That's right.[font italic=false][lr]::
21066::$$$message_0167_0012_0001$$$::You are correct, Shirou Emiya.[lr]::
21067::$$$message_0167_0012_0002$$$::The wickedness of your misconceptions and sentiment may have been memorable,[lr]::
21068::$$$message_0167_0012_0003$$$::but I wanted to yearn for the things you felt were beautiful, too.[lr]::
21069::$$$message_0167_0012_0004$$$::I only wanted to yearn for them...::
21070::$$$message_0167_0013_0000$$$::Stars blanket the sky.[lr]::
21071::$$$message_0167_0013_0001$$$::The long hymn ends, leaving a dry echo in the ruins.[lr]::
21072::$$$message_0167_0013_0002$$$::Clap, clap, clap.[lr]::
21073::$$$message_0167_0013_0003$$$::There's no crackling sound from the fire.[lr]::
21074::$$$message_0167_0013_0004$$$::The only such sound comes from my hands.[lr]::
21075::$$$message_0167_0013_0005$$$::Which is to say, I'm clapping for some reason.::
21076::$$$message_0167_0014_0000$$$::And she's standing in front of me, as always.[lr]::
21077::$$$message_0167_0014_0001$$$::She isn't wearing her usual, priestly calm.[lr]::
21078::$$$message_0167_0014_0002$$$::"...I'm glad you like it. Thank you for listening."[lr]::
21079::$$$message_0167_0014_0003$$$::For the first time[line len=2]and the last, I'm sure[line len=2]she gives me a girlish smile.::
21080::$$$message_0167_0015_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21081::$$$message_0167_0015_0001$$$::What is this?[lr]::
21082::$$$message_0167_0015_0002$$$::Usually, she looks so expectant. Is this all it takes to satisfy her?[lr]::
21083::$$$message_0167_0015_0003$$$::A gesture I barely even thought about?[lr]::
21084::$$$message_0167_0015_0004$$$::...Well, damn.[lr]::
21085::$$$message_0167_0015_0005$$$::I guess I need to be better at reading the room.::
21086::$$$message_0167_0016_0000$$$::"Hey, there. That was a pretty long piece today.[lr]::
21087::$$$message_0167_0016_0001$$$::It's getting late, too. Are you feeling all right?"::
21088::$$$message_0167_0017_0000$$$::"I am, because you're at peace right now. We shouldn't have any problems as long as you keep your distance."[lr]::
21089::$$$message_0167_0017_0001$$$::"That's not what I meant. You've been stomping on that pedal for hours. It looks tiring."::
21090::$$$message_0167_0018_0000$$$::"Oh. Then, yes, I'm not tired at all. I could keep playing all day, if you want."[lr]::
21091::$$$message_0167_0018_0001$$$::"Wow, that's impressive, but no thanks. I don't have [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] much free time."::
21092::$$$message_0167_0019_0000$$$::Just a few hours of listening to music was enough to make me all sentimental, like a little kid.[lr]::
21093::$$$message_0167_0019_0001$$$::If I listened for a full 24 hours, I might even regress into a baby.::
21094::$$$message_0167_0020_0000$$$::"Still, though...[lr]::
21095::$$$message_0167_0020_0001$$$::This place is a complete ruin."[lr]::
21096::$$$message_0167_0020_0002$$$::I look around the chapel.[lr]::
21097::$$$message_0167_0020_0003$$$::This is the only decrepit building in bright, flourishing Fuyuki.[lr]::
21098::$$$message_0167_0020_0004$$$::Everyone's here. Nobody has been lost, save for the one who doesn't exist.::
21099::$$$message_0167_0021_0000$$$::Kirei Kotomine.[lr]::
21100::$$$message_0167_0021_0001$$$::He's the only person who wasn't recreated.[lr]::
21101::$$$message_0167_0021_0002$$$::There was no possible outcome in which he survived the Fifth Holy Grail War.::
21102::$$$message_0167_0022_0000$$$::...He was fated to die once he survived the fourth war.[lr]::
21103::$$$message_0167_0022_0001$$$::This girl used that opportunity to interfere in the war's reenactment. Kotomine is gone, but his role as the war's overseer remains.[lr]::
21104::$$$message_0167_0022_0002$$$::Caren Hortensia slid into that opening.::
21105::$$$message_0167_0023_0000$$$::"Hey, within the real four days...wait, no. Does the church look this bad in real life?"::
21106::$$$message_0167_0024_0000$$$::"It never reached this state of disrepair, no.[lr]::
21107::$$$message_0167_0024_0001$$$::I believe I'm cleaning it as we speak."[lr]::
21108::$$$message_0167_0024_0002$$$::"Makes sense. But you're here, too.[lr]::
21109::$$$message_0167_0024_0003$$$::I thought this was the real you this whole time."::
21110::$$$message_0167_0025_0000$$$::"I shouldn't even exist here, so I cannot physically interfere. I only sent the variable 'Caren Hortensia' into this walled garden.[lr]::
21111::$$$message_0167_0025_0001$$$::Because I only exist during these four days, I can persist without being recycled through the time loop. But it also means that I'll disappear once these four days finally end."::
21112::$$$message_0167_0026_0000$$$::"Like a Servant, then.[lr]::
21113::$$$message_0167_0026_0001$$$::You're clearly the actual Caren, but once your summoning ends, you'll disappear without taking your memories with you."::
21114::$$$message_0167_0027_0000$$$::"That's right. Anything I discuss with you here won't reach the me on the outside.[lr]::
21115::$$$message_0167_0027_0001$$$::...For those like Shirou Emiya and Rin Tohsaka, who have always existed, the memory would remain like a dream just woken up from, but in my case, the experience will remain here."::
21116::$$$message_0167_0028_0000$$$::"Huh. That's like dying, then. Aren't you scared?"[lr]::
21117::$$$message_0167_0028_0001$$$::"...Do you ever feel reluctant to wake up from a dream?"::
21118::$$$message_0167_0029_0000$$$::"Nope. Ah, so it doesn't feel quite real.[lr]::
21119::$$$message_0167_0029_0001$$$::Then it would be hard to make sense of since you're here at all times. In a way, you're like a ghost."::
21120::$$$message_0167_0030_0000$$$::"...I am no illusion. While we can't touch each other, I am physically real.[lr]::
21121::$$$message_0167_0030_0001$$$::I believe you know that by now. My claws have shredded you on more than one occasion."::
21122::$$$message_0167_0031_0000$$$::"We do have that kind of relationship, don't we?[lr]::
21123::$$$message_0167_0031_0001$$$::...Hm. So isn't this pretty hard on you right now? I feel pretty uncertain myself,[lr]::
21124::$$$message_0167_0031_0002$$$::so it must be unbearable for you."::
21125::$$$message_0167_0032_0000$$$::"I-I'm making a special effort to put up with it right now.[lr]::
21126::$$$message_0167_0032_0001$$$::...You don't need to worry about me. I'm well accustomed to such tests of endurance. Meanwhile, you're weakened, so I will keep the effects in check."::
21127::$$$message_0167_0033_0000$$$::...It sure sounds like a pain.[lr]::
21128::$$$message_0167_0033_0001$$$::She's supposedly here to guide me, but she's hamstrung and can't get close to the person she's supposed to help.[lr]::
21129::$$$message_0167_0033_0002$$$::I can only touch her as Shirou Emiya.[lr]::
21130::$$$message_0167_0033_0003$$$::But even that's become less certain since I started visiting this church.::
21131::$$$message_0167_0034_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21132::$$$message_0167_0034_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
21133::$$$message_0167_0034_0002$$$::Silence.[lr]::
21134::$$$message_0167_0034_0003$$$::Some primal instinct in me tells me it would be risky to dig any deeper, so I shut up.[lr]::
21135::$$$message_0167_0034_0004$$$::As for her... She doesn't seem to mind.[lr]::
21136::$$$message_0167_0034_0005$$$::She never seemed to like these pauses before.[lr]::
21137::$$$message_0167_0034_0006$$$::Today, though, I'm the one who can't take the awkward silence.::
21138::$$$message_0167_0035_0000$$$::"Hey. What does 'Hortensia' mean?"[lr]::
21139::$$$message_0167_0035_0001$$$::I suddenly speak up.[lr]::
21140::$$$message_0167_0035_0002$$$::Just so you know, I'm not actually interested at all in the answer.::
21141::$$$message_0167_0036_0000$$$::"It's the name of a purple hydrangea, in the language of my homeland."[lr]::
21142::$$$message_0167_0036_0001$$$::She looks at me inquisitively. What does she expect from me?[lr]::
21143::$$$message_0167_0036_0002$$$::I certainly don't have an opinion on it.::
21144::$$$message_0167_0037_0000$$$::"Huh. Nice name."[lr]::
21145::$$$message_0167_0037_0001$$$::I remark noncommittally.::
21146::$$$message_0167_0038_0000$$$::"Yes. I don't remember what my mother looked like, but I am fond of her maiden name.[lr]::
21147::$$$message_0167_0038_0001$$$::I was also told that the name 'Caren' comes from my father's language."::
21148::$$$message_0167_0039_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21149::$$$message_0167_0039_0001$$$::I shouldn't have asked.[lr]::
21150::$$$message_0167_0039_0002$$$::The sarcasm was utterly lost on her.[lr]::
21151::$$$message_0167_0039_0003$$$::A purple hydrangea.[lr]::
21152::$$$message_0167_0039_0004$$$::The image of snails oozing under the petals fits you, for sure.[lr]::
21153::$$$message_0167_0039_0005$$$::But she smiles, as if she finds it beautiful.::
21154::$$$message_0167_0040_0000$$$::...I've had enough.[lr]::
21155::$$$message_0167_0040_0001$$$::I shouldn't say it.[lr]::
21156::$$$message_0167_0040_0002$$$::I don't want to say it.[lr]::
21157::$$$message_0167_0040_0003$$$::That isn't why I'm here.[lr]::
21158::$$$message_0167_0040_0004$$$::I should go.[lr]::
21159::$$$message_0167_0040_0005$$$::Any more, and I'll leave something I didn't mean to.::
21160::$$$message_0167_0041_0000$$$::I get up.[lr]::
21161::$$$message_0167_0041_0001$$$::Violently, I turn my back on her.::
21162::$$$message_0167_0042_0000$$$::"Hey. I'm probably going to stop coming here..."[lr]::
21163::$$$message_0167_0042_0001$$$::I don't need to say it. I don't need to ask.[lr]::
21164::$$$message_0167_0042_0002$$$::So why do I keep...[lr]::
21165::$$$message_0167_0042_0003$$$::"Can you keep living this way, though?"[lr]::
21166::$$$message_0167_0042_0004$$$::I already know the answer.::
21167::$$$message_0167_0043_0000$$$::"...Yes. I don't know any other way to live.[lr]::
21168::$$$message_0167_0043_0001$$$::If this is my destiny, then I only need to abide by it."[lr]::
21169::$$$message_0167_0043_0002$$$::A purple hydrangea.[lr]::
21170::$$$message_0167_0043_0003$$$::A beautiful silver song.[lr]::
21171::$$$message_0167_0043_0004$$$::A prayer in the early dawn, soaked by rain day after day.::
21172::$$$message_0167_0044_0000$$$::"You've gotta be kidding me. You're happy to live as a human sacrifice?"::
21173::$$$message_0167_0045_0000$$$::"It is difficult, I admit, but worthwhile.[lr]::
21174::$$$message_0167_0045_0001$$$::I'm hardly the only one suffering, after all. But if I can save the spiritually afflicted with my own body, then I will."::
21175::$$$message_0167_0046_0000$$$::But who's going to save you?[lr]::
21176::$$$message_0167_0046_0001$$$::I'm not just talking about her skin and muscles tearing.[lr]::
21177::$$$message_0167_0046_0002$$$::Her organs will become useless as she's destroyed from within.[lr]::
21178::$$$message_0167_0046_0003$$$::Those dreary golden eyes...[lr]::
21179::$$$message_0167_0046_0004$$$::Her lame right thigh...[lr]::
21180::$$$message_0167_0046_0005$$$::Eventually, she won't even be able to cross her fingers in prayer.[lr]::
21181::$$$message_0167_0046_0006$$$::They'll all stop working one day.::
21182::$$$message_0167_0047_0000$$$::And she says that she's fine with that.[lr]::
21183::$$$message_0167_0047_0001$$$::Just like a certain fool who accepts everything in the world.[lr]::
21184::$$$message_0167_0047_0002$$$::"...Shit. I knew I shouldn't have said that."[lr]::
21185::$$$message_0167_0047_0003$$$::Ahh. In the very end, I have to face the facts.[lr]::
21186::$$$message_0167_0047_0004$$$::This should be familiar to me.[lr]::
21187::$$$message_0167_0047_0005$$$::She has no color of her own, like a pure-white flower.::
21188::$$$message_0167_0048_0000$$$::I feel like a bee who just stumbled on sweet nectar.[lr]::
21189::$$$message_0167_0048_0001$$$::My lips tremble.[lr]::
21190::$$$message_0167_0048_0002$$$::My voice comes out without me telling it to.::
21191::$$$message_0167_0049_0000$$$::"...I'm starving."[lr]::
21192::$$$message_0167_0049_0001$$$::"Huh? What did you just..."::
21193::$$$message_0167_0050_0000$$$::"I said I'm hungry. Bless me, Sister."[lr]::
21194::$$$message_0167_0050_0001$$$::"What are you..."[lr]::
21195::$$$message_0167_0050_0002$$$::Cute. She wants to know what I'm doing.[lr]::
21196::$$$message_0167_0050_0003$$$::Isn't it obvious?::
21197::$$$message_0167_0051_0000$$$::"I said I'm going to eat you."[lr]::
21198::$$$message_0167_0051_0001$$$::It's brutally simple.[lr]::
21199::$$$message_0167_0051_0002$$$::I'm hungry, and now I need[line len=2][font italic=true]want[font italic=false], nutrition[line len=2][font italic=true]magical energy[font italic=false].[lr]::
21200::$$$message_0167_0051_0003$$$::The flower girl accepts my words and everything they contain.[lr]::
21201::$$$message_0167_0051_0004$$$::I hate that I know exactly how she'll respond.[lr]::
21202::$$$message_0167_0051_0005$$$::A white flower can be dyed any color, at any time.::
21203::$$$message_0167_0052_0000$$$::"...Why? You never asked for this before."[lr]::
21204::$$$message_0167_0052_0001$$$::"Who knows? I eat because I'm hungry. That's how appetite works. I just..."[lr]::
21205::$$$message_0167_0052_0002$$$::I can't take this anymore, so I'm going to eat her.::
21206::$$$message_0167_0053_0000$$$::"...Have you lost your mind? You know better than anyone what will happen if you lay hands on me with that in mind."[lr]::
21207::$$$message_0167_0053_0001$$$::Of course I know.[lr]::
21208::$$$message_0167_0053_0002$$$::If I let my appetite drive me to touch her, she'll react to the demonic possession, and I will get hurt in the same way.[lr]::
21209::$$$message_0167_0053_0003$$$::I can consume her magical energy, but I'll take just as much damage.::
21210::$$$message_0167_0054_0000$$$::It makes sense.[lr]::
21211::$$$message_0167_0054_0001$$$::That's how that rule works.[lr]::
21212::$$$message_0167_0054_0002$$$::Normally, I'd die.[lr]::
21213::$$$message_0167_0054_0003$$$::On top of that, this shell I've worn for so long would fall away, leaving only the grotesque corpse beneath it.[lr]::
21214::$$$message_0167_0054_0004$$$::"Am I worth it?"[lr]::
21215::$$$message_0167_0054_0005$$$::That's what the girl says.[lr]::
21216::$$$message_0167_0054_0006$$$::That's what the flower says.::
21217::$$$message_0167_0055_0000$$$::Deliberately, I don't answer and turn away.[lr]::
21218::$$$message_0167_0055_0001$$$::"That shit doesn't matter. I'm starving to death.[lr]::
21219::$$$message_0167_0055_0002$$$::You wouldn't turn away the needy, would you, Sister?"[lr]::
21220::$$$message_0167_0055_0003$$$::Again, I phrase the words suggestively, and flash her a wicked grin.[lr]::
21221::$$$message_0167_0055_0004$$$::That's how you live, isn't it? Your sole source of pride?[lr]::
21222::$$$message_0167_0055_0005$$$::Come on, white flower.[lr]::
21223::$$$message_0167_0055_0006$$$::Answer me.::
21224::$$$message_0167_0056_0000$$$::"...I understand,"[lr]::
21225::$$$message_0167_0056_0001$$$::she murmurs curtly.[lr]::
21226::$$$message_0167_0056_0002$$$::Half of it sounds sullen; an impulsive reaction to my taunting.[lr]::
21227::$$$message_0167_0056_0003$$$::Half of it sounds defiant; a bluff of childishness and pride.::
21228::$$$message_0167_0057_0000$$$::I turn back towards her mixed expression.[lr]::
21229::$$$message_0167_0057_0001$$$::I forcefully pull her bandaged arm and climb the steps.::
21230::$$$message_0167_0058_0000$$$::The long narrow stairway leading to her chambers.[lr]::
21231::$$$message_0167_0058_0001$$$::It's a gray, barren room, just as I imagined.::
21232::$$$message_0167_0059_0000$$$::"Boring room.[lr]::
21233::$$$message_0167_0059_0001$$$::But that light was from your room this whole time, huh?"[lr]::
21234::$$$message_0167_0059_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
21235::$$$message_0167_0059_0003$$$::"Stop pretending to be classy. You were watching from here, weren't you?[lr]::
21236::$$$message_0167_0059_0004$$$::Every time Shirou Emiya got skewered, eaten, and decapitated...[lr]::
21237::$$$message_0167_0059_0005$$$::I wonder what you were thinking while you watched from your pedestal. I bet you weren't sitting still.[lr]::
21238::$$$message_0167_0059_0006$$$::After all, every time I died, I was surrounded by demons."::
21239::$$$message_0167_0060_0000$$$::"...What are you trying to say?"[lr]::
21240::$$$message_0167_0060_0001$$$::Her voice is hoarse.[lr]::
21241::$$$message_0167_0060_0002$$$::She's already this bad? All I did was take one step closer. It's like watching a feverish patient on the verge of death. That goes to show that we have no time to spare, but I run my mouth.::
21242::$$$message_0167_0061_0000$$$::"Oh, nothing. I heard that you don't take chastity very seriously, Sister, but I'm not criticizing you for it.[lr]::
21243::$$$message_0167_0061_0001$$$::Just stating the facts. Always watching the sacrificial lamb get slaughtered from here...I bet you were having some fun with yourself, weren't you?"::
21244::$$$message_0167_0062_0000$$$::"H-how dare you...!"[lr]::
21245::$$$message_0167_0062_0001$$$::Her downcast face whips up to look at me.[lr]::
21246::$$$message_0167_0062_0002$$$::Is that shame, or anger?[lr]::
21247::$$$message_0167_0062_0003$$$::She glares at me with reddened cheeks and a tearful expression.::
21248::$$$message_0167_0063_0000$$$::I ignore it and reach for her.[lr]::
21249::$$$message_0167_0063_0001$$$::We're more than close enough to touch now, but her nun's outfit is dampening the mood.[lr]::
21250::$$$message_0167_0063_0002$$$::It isn't sexy at all. In fact, its godly aura is nauseating.[lr]::
21251::$$$message_0167_0063_0003$$$::Not that I care at this point.::
21252::$$$message_0167_0064_0000$$$::"Aŋ... No, Shirou Emiya. Are you really..."[lr]::
21253::$$$message_0167_0064_0001$$$::I see fear in her golden eyes.[lr]::
21254::$$$message_0167_0064_0002$$$::She's offered herself up countless times before, so what's the use being scared now?::
21255::$$$message_0167_0065_0000$$$::"I'll feel better once I do it.[lr]::
21256::$$$message_0167_0065_0001$$$::You already said you understand. Chickening out now?"[lr]::
21257::$$$message_0167_0065_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
21258::$$$message_0167_0065_0003$$$::She doesn't argue.[lr]::
21259::$$$message_0167_0065_0004$$$::She doesn't resist.[lr]::
21260::$$$message_0167_0065_0005$$$::...The anxiety makes my cheek itch.[lr]::
21261::$$$message_0167_0065_0006$$$::I scratch around my cheek with my nails,[lr]::
21262::$$$message_0167_0065_0007$$$::and get a good look at the offering laid out before me.::
21263::$$$message_0167_0066_0000$$$::"Ngh...!?"[lr]::
21264::$$$message_0167_0066_0001$$$::First, I grab her by the arms.[lr]::
21265::$$$message_0167_0066_0002$$$::I forcefully pull her into my chest.::
21266::$$$message_0167_0067_0000$$$::"As you are now, my body...will..."[lr]::
21267::$$$message_0167_0067_0001$$$::She won't be able to stop it from killing me, right?[lr]::
21268::$$$message_0167_0067_0002$$$::I don't care about that now.[lr]::
21269::$$$message_0167_0067_0003$$$::She can kill me if she wants. If I die, so be it.::
21270::$$$message_0167_0068_0000$$$::"Hey, you don't turn down anyone, do you? I'm the same way. You're going to keep up with me until the very end."[lr]::
21271::$$$message_0167_0068_0001$$$::"...!"[lr]::
21272::$$$message_0167_0068_0002$$$::It must be because I'm so close now.[lr]::
21273::$$$message_0167_0068_0003$$$::Her breathing suddenly grows ragged.::
21274::$$$message_0167_0069_0000$$$::She kicks her feet wildly at the floor for support. I don't care. She can't overpower me.[lr]::
21275::$$$message_0167_0069_0001$$$::I force our beating hearts closer together.[lr]::
21276::$$$message_0167_0069_0002$$$::It feels more like we're wrestling than embracing.[lr]::
21277::$$$message_0167_0069_0003$$$::She tries to escape, but I grab her arms, pin her body down, and bring my fangs[line len=2]my pointed canines to her pale neck...::
21278::$$$message_0167_0070_0000$$$::...I bite into the white flower's stem.[lr]::
21279::$$$message_0167_0070_0001$$$::"Hah...!"[lr]::
21280::$$$message_0167_0070_0002$$$::I sink my fangs into the woman's neck and directly devour her soul.[lr]::
21281::$$$message_0167_0070_0003$$$::Without even thinking about it, I can feel the magical energy flowing through my fangs, sunk deep into her flesh. The feeling of her in my arms isn't half bad, either. Ha. Both sensations are quite delectable, if I say so myself.::
21282::$$$message_0167_0071_0000$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
21283::$$$message_0167_0071_0001$$$::Defiance and shame muddle her gasps.[lr]::
21284::$$$message_0167_0071_0002$$$::It's such a girlish reaction, but not the one I want.[lr]::
21285::$$$message_0167_0071_0003$$$::I want magical energy. That's all this is.[lr]::
21286::$$$message_0167_0071_0004$$$::I want despair. I want to break her even if it doesn't mean anything.[lr]::
21287::$$$message_0167_0071_0005$$$::I'll take anything. Right now, it's time to lust for the prey in front of me.::
21288::$$$message_0167_0072_0000$$$::"N-no..."[lr]::
21289::$$$message_0167_0072_0001$$$::I won't let her go.[lr]::
21290::$$$message_0167_0072_0002$$$::I push my red-hot fangs into her, to melt her from the inside.::
21291::$$$message_0167_0073_0000$$$::"Ngh, ahh."[lr]::
21292::$$$message_0167_0073_0001$$$::I connect to her soul and nourish myself, plundering her magical energy.[lr]::
21293::$$$message_0167_0073_0002$$$::A regular human would've burnt out by now, but as expected, she hangs in there, merely struggling to breathe.[lr]::
21294::$$$message_0167_0073_0003$$$::The agony should be enough to kill someone.[lr]::
21295::$$$message_0167_0073_0004$$$::What a remarkable act of self-sacrifice.::
21296::$$$message_0167_0074_0000$$$::"...Hah...mgh..."[lr]::
21297::$$$message_0167_0074_0001$$$::Her labored breathing.[lr]::
21298::$$$message_0167_0074_0002$$$::Her strained voice.[lr]::
21299::$$$message_0167_0074_0003$$$::I pay it no mind. She's at my mercy, and I keep taking from her.[lr]::
21300::$$$message_0167_0074_0004$$$::Without end, I drink the magical energy through my teeth embedded in her skin.::
21301::$$$message_0167_0075_0000$$$::It's a hug, if only in name.[lr]::
21302::$$$message_0167_0075_0001$$$::But there's nothing else to it. Nothing at all.[lr]::
21303::$$$message_0167_0075_0002$$$::Not love, that's for sure.[lr]::
21304::$$$message_0167_0075_0003$$$::If I had to describe this, I'd call it appetite and self-sacrifice: [lr]::
21305::$$$message_0167_0075_0004$$$::the life function of ingesting magical energy, and the determination to provide it.[lr]::
21306::$$$message_0167_0075_0005$$$::The simple act of exposing a woman. A contract that forces the other to submit.::
21307::$$$message_0167_0076_0000$$$::That's what kissing means, to a demon.[lr]::
21308::$$$message_0167_0076_0001$$$::I draw out her insides, her very soul. Instead of replacing what's lost...[lr]::
21309::$$$message_0167_0076_0002$$$::...I dye it in my own color.[lr]::
21310::$$$message_0167_0076_0003$$$::This is an act that comes from a desire to destroy someone else.[lr]::
21311::$$$message_0167_0076_0004$$$::I wonder...would a creature who knows nothing but hate call it passion?::
21312::$$$message_0167_0077_0000$$$::"Hah... You know, don't you...? We can't touch each other...so why are you doing this..."[lr]::
21313::$$$message_0167_0077_0001$$$::She stirs, slightly.[lr]::
21314::$$$message_0167_0077_0002$$$::It isn't to protect herself.[lr]::
21315::$$$message_0167_0077_0003$$$::Our mere proximity is dangerous. If I keep touching her this much, she won't be able to stop herself from impaling me.::
21316::$$$message_0167_0078_0000$$$::"Just suck it up. Stop acting like a cat in heat..."[lr]::
21317::$$$message_0167_0078_0001$$$::I pull my teeth away just enough to speak.[lr]::
21318::$$$message_0167_0078_0002$$$::But that's wasting time.[lr]::
21319::$$$message_0167_0078_0003$$$::Midway through my sentence, I bring my fangs back to her alabaster skin, press against it, and tense my jaw while putting the weight of my body behind the bite.::
21320::$$$message_0167_0079_0000$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
21321::$$$message_0167_0079_0001$$$::It looks like she's doing everything she can to restrain herself.[lr]::
21322::$$$message_0167_0079_0002$$$::She grits her teeth in anguish while showing no resistance.[lr]::
21323::$$$message_0167_0079_0003$$$::...Emotions are running wild in my head.[lr]::
21324::$$$message_0167_0079_0004$$$::My entire rational facade is crumbling away.::
21325::$$$message_0167_0080_0000$$$::I try to hang on to the last shreds of my reason, just as she tries to hold in the spiritual affliction.[lr]::
21326::$$$message_0167_0080_0001$$$::For her, it's a simple matter of physical endurance.[lr]::
21327::$$$message_0167_0080_0002$$$::Unfortunately, for me, it's a contest of the mind.[lr]::
21328::$$$message_0167_0080_0003$$$::She only needs to worry about her body's physical changes. Ultimately, it won't affect her soul deep within.[lr]::
21329::$$$message_0167_0080_0004$$$::How very fitting for a sacrificial maiden. She just needs to accept everyone else's desire.::
21330::$$$message_0167_0081_0000$$$::"...Are you going to burst?[lr]::
21331::$$$message_0167_0081_0001$$$::Interesting. Let's see who breaks first."[lr]::
21332::$$$message_0167_0081_0002$$$::...I'm pissed that I said it out loud.[lr]::
21333::$$$message_0167_0081_0003$$$::The hatred and savage impulse threaten to tear my head open.[lr]::
21334::$$$message_0167_0081_0004$$$::If she wants me to mess her up, then I'll grant that wish.::
21335::$$$message_0167_0082_0000$$$::"Rrgh, aargh, aah...!"[lr]::
21336::$$$message_0167_0082_0001$$$::Trembling all over, her voice grows louder.[lr]::
21337::$$$message_0167_0082_0002$$$::Is it the agony of being ripped apart from the inside,[lr]::
21338::$$$message_0167_0082_0003$$$::or the terror she's facing from the outside?[lr]::
21339::$$$message_0167_0082_0004$$$::There's no point in trying to figure it out.[lr]::
21340::$$$message_0167_0082_0005$$$::Either way, her pain will only get worse.::
21341::$$$message_0167_0083_0000$$$::Let's say, for example's sake, that we're both normal, upstanding people.[lr]::
21342::$$$message_0167_0083_0001$$$::We'd probably put our arms around each other, touch each other with our fingers, and make each other comfortable. We'd give and take in kind, and something would well up.[lr]::
21343::$$$message_0167_0083_0002$$$::Normal. Upstanding.[lr]::
21344::$$$message_0167_0083_0003$$$::People.[lr]::
21345::$$$message_0167_0083_0004$$$::But that's not who we are.[lr]::
21346::$$$message_0167_0083_0005$$$::Not who [font italic=true]I[font italic=false] am.[lr]::
21347::$$$message_0167_0083_0006$$$::I might pretend to do what humans can do and maintain the shell of being one, but that's all it is[line len=2]an act.::
21348::$$$message_0167_0084_0000$$$::"...Ngh...Hah...ah..."[lr]::
21349::$$$message_0167_0084_0001$$$::I can almost see the color in her desperate gasps.[lr]::
21350::$$$message_0167_0084_0002$$$::Her entire body is hot with feverish heat.[lr]::
21351::$$$message_0167_0084_0003$$$::I should have already taken a more-than-fatal amount of magical energy from her, causing effects to her body by now.::
21352::$$$message_0167_0085_0000$$$::"...Whew...whew...ah..."[lr]::
21353::$$$message_0167_0085_0001$$$::Her labored panting echoes in the stone room.[lr]::
21354::$$$message_0167_0085_0002$$$::Wordlessly, she begs someone to stop this.::
21355::$$$message_0167_0086_0000$$$::But her pleas stop before they reach her lips, and she gazes at the sinner. At me.[lr]::
21356::$$$message_0167_0086_0001$$$::It's as if...[lr]::
21357::$$$message_0167_0086_0002$$$::As if she's trying to show me how many times she's done this before.[lr]::
21358::$$$message_0167_0086_0003$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
21359::$$$message_0167_0086_0004$$$::Her eyes bore into me.[lr]::
21360::$$$message_0167_0086_0005$$$::I can feel her hot breaths, and for a moment, our eyes meet.::
21361::$$$message_0167_0087_0000$$$::"It's cold...I'm touching you...but you're so painful...and cold..."[lr]::
21362::$$$message_0167_0087_0001$$$::The more her pain grows, the more strength she gains to push me away.[lr]::
21363::$$$message_0167_0087_0002$$$::Our gap in strength can be reversed in just an instant.[lr]::
21364::$$$message_0167_0087_0003$$$::All she needs to do is give up.[lr]::
21365::$$$message_0167_0087_0004$$$::It'll end with me getting impaled like I always do, and then she won't have to suffer anymore.::
21366::$$$message_0167_0088_0000$$$::"Nngh...!"[lr]::
21367::$$$message_0167_0088_0001$$$::But she's trying to fight through the pain.[lr]::
21368::$$$message_0167_0088_0002$$$::...Caren isn't fighting me.[lr]::
21369::$$$message_0167_0088_0003$$$::It's like she's praying for an end to [font italic=true]my[font italic=false] suffering.[lr]::
21370::$$$message_0167_0088_0004$$$::Even now, the flower is white and unstained, standing tall in the flames, like a saint.::
21371::$$$message_0167_0089_0000$$$::Ha...[lr]::
21372::$$$message_0167_0089_0001$$$::I laugh.[lr]::
21373::$$$message_0167_0089_0002$$$::How can I not?::
21374::$$$message_0167_0090_0000$$$::"Ah...what did you just...do to my neck...?"[lr]::
21375::$$$message_0167_0090_0001$$$::Without releasing my jaw, I run my tongue across her skin.[lr]::
21376::$$$message_0167_0090_0002$$$::This is the best way to confirm the taste.[lr]::
21377::$$$message_0167_0090_0003$$$::"Hnngh...!"[lr]::
21378::$$$message_0167_0090_0004$$$::I smell blood. I bite down again with renewed vigor so that it hurts her more.[lr]::
21379::$$$message_0167_0090_0005$$$::I weaken my magical energy ingesting function and let my teeth search for purchase.::
21380::$$$message_0167_0091_0000$$$::"Hah, ngh..."[lr]::
21381::$$$message_0167_0091_0001$$$::She grits her teeth and withstands the pain.[lr]::
21382::$$$message_0167_0091_0002$$$::The weight of my body pressing down on hers and the warmth of her body in my arms, feel like it's melting my skin.[lr]::
21383::$$$message_0167_0091_0003$$$::Such warmth.[lr]::
21384::$$$message_0167_0091_0004$$$::She should be a corpse by now, but this is almost like...[lr]::
21385::$$$message_0167_0091_0005$$$::...What an awful woman. This is just like hellfire.::
21386::$$$message_0167_0092_0000$$$::Deep inside, I tremble.[lr]::
21387::$$$message_0167_0092_0001$$$::Prime cuts of meat deserve to be enjoyed on a spit.::
21388::$$$message_0167_0093_0000$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
21389::$$$message_0167_0093_0001$$$::I hug her tightly.[lr]::
21390::$$$message_0167_0093_0002$$$::I support her body with both arms and lean into her, hoping to dig my fangs even deeper.[lr]::
21391::$$$message_0167_0093_0003$$$::I don't care what's going on with her body.[lr]::
21392::$$$message_0167_0093_0004$$$::Using my knife-like canines, I drink deeply from her magical energy.::
21393::$$$message_0167_0094_0000$$$::"No, wait..."[lr]::
21394::$$$message_0167_0094_0001$$$::She tries to pause her labored panting long enough to say something.[lr]::
21395::$$$message_0167_0094_0002$$$::But I have no reason to stop.[lr]::
21396::$$$message_0167_0094_0003$$$::You've already accepted me.::
21397::$$$message_0167_0095_0000$$$::If you don't like it, then just take the easy way out.[lr]::
21398::$$$message_0167_0095_0001$$$::You can kill me anytime you want.[lr]::
21399::$$$message_0167_0095_0002$$$::If you can't take it, then let your body run wild, and rest.::
21400::$$$message_0167_0096_0000$$$::"Nngh... I'm willing to accept you, but..."[lr]::
21401::$$$message_0167_0096_0001$$$::She can't control her breathing.[lr]::
21402::$$$message_0167_0096_0002$$$::Her hoarse voice tells me she can't take this anymore.[lr]::
21403::$$$message_0167_0096_0003$$$::"It's...a little...strong... I didn't expect...it would hurt this... much..."[lr]::
21404::$$$message_0167_0096_0004$$$::I guess she doesn't like the biting.::
21405::$$$message_0167_0097_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21406::$$$message_0167_0097_0001$$$::It lights a fire within me,[lr]::
21407::$$$message_0167_0097_0002$$$::the opposite effect of what she wanted.::
21408::$$$message_0167_0098_0000$$$::"Please...rein yourself in a little...Shirou Emiya..."[lr]::
21409::$$$message_0167_0098_0001$$$::Like I said, I don't care.[lr]::
21410::$$$message_0167_0098_0002$$$::I want this woman. It's too much trouble to think about anything else.::
21411::$$$message_0167_0099_0000$$$::"Hngh...!"[lr]::
21412::$$$message_0167_0099_0001$$$::I ignore her and keep feeding on her neck.[lr]::
21413::$$$message_0167_0099_0002$$$::Her muscles convulse as if trying to resist.[lr]::
21414::$$$message_0167_0099_0003$$$::She tenses like a bow, as if being electrocuted.::
21415::$$$message_0167_0100_0000$$$::"Ngh, ahh...!"[lr]::
21416::$$$message_0167_0100_0001$$$::I gorge myself on her magical energy.[lr]::
21417::$$$message_0167_0100_0002$$$::The well is drilled and tapped, so all I need to do is draw from it.[lr]::
21418::$$$message_0167_0100_0003$$$::There's no trick to it, no special skill.[lr]::
21419::$$$message_0167_0100_0004$$$::I just need to force my way past her feeble resistance.::
21420::$$$message_0167_0101_0000$$$::"Hrrk..."[lr]::
21421::$$$message_0167_0101_0001$$$::I don't feel full yet.[lr]::
21422::$$$message_0167_0101_0002$$$::The real feast starts now.[lr]::
21423::$$$message_0167_0101_0003$$$::All I feel is [movefg opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=50 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se697.wav][movefg opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=800 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=false time=400]a crack, an unpleasant fissure opening up in my body.::
21424::$$$message_0167_0102_0000$$$::"Haah, hah, ah... Why...?"[lr]::
21425::$$$message_0167_0102_0001$$$::...She sounds dumbfounded.[lr]::
21426::$$$message_0167_0102_0002$$$::She meets my eyes, looking puzzled.[lr]::
21427::$$$message_0167_0102_0003$$$::Yes, my eyes reflect your image.::
21428::$$$message_0167_0103_0000$$$::"Are you...all right...?"[lr]::
21429::$$$message_0167_0103_0001$$$::What's that supposed to mean?[lr]::
21430::$$$message_0167_0103_0002$$$::No one ever said that a demon would turn to ash for trying to eat a saint.::
21431::$$$message_0167_0104_0000$$$::Ha. Am I all right?[lr]::
21432::$$$message_0167_0104_0001$$$::That should be my line.[lr]::
21433::$$$message_0167_0104_0002$$$::"You're the one that can be killed first, you know,"[lr]::
21434::$$$message_0167_0104_0003$$$::I tell her with my eyes.[lr]::
21435::$$$message_0167_0104_0004$$$::"How long are you going to be afraid?"[lr]::
21436::$$$message_0167_0104_0005$$$::"No matter how this looks, right now, you have the upper hand, not me."::
21437::$$$message_0167_0105_0000$$$::"N-no, I would never... Mm!"[lr]::
21438::$$$message_0167_0105_0001$$$::She answers my gaze.[lr]::
21439::$$$message_0167_0105_0002$$$::I think she's trying to tell me that she won't be possessed.[lr]::
21440::$$$message_0167_0105_0003$$$::But no matter how strong her willpower is, her body is gradually morphing into the body of a woman who's put on weight.::
21441::$$$message_0167_0106_0000$$$::"Hah, guh...!"[lr]::
21442::$$$message_0167_0106_0001$$$::She's afraid of giving her body over to her impulses.[lr]::
21443::$$$message_0167_0106_0002$$$::I bet she'd be an easy target for demons if she let her mind weaken.[lr]::
21444::$$$message_0167_0106_0003$$$::To avoid killing me, she's trying to suffer through the pain and impulse of having her body violated.[lr]::
21445::$$$message_0167_0106_0004$$$::It's beyond ridiculous.[lr]::
21446::$$$message_0167_0106_0005$$$::She should just let herself go, let her mind go blank, and put an end to all of this.::
21447::$$$message_0167_0107_0000$$$::"No...the fangs...again...!"[lr]::
21448::$$$message_0167_0107_0001$$$::There's a quiet sound of limbs tearing apart from within.[lr]::
21449::$$$message_0167_0107_0002$$$::"...!"[lr]::
21450::$$$message_0167_0107_0003$$$::It has to hurt.[lr]::
21451::$$$message_0167_0107_0004$$$::I'm sure it's a terrible ordeal, having someone wring your magical energy dry.::
21452::$$$message_0167_0108_0000$$$::"Haah... Ah..."[lr]::
21453::$$$message_0167_0108_0001$$$::Her voice is pained.[lr]::
21454::$$$message_0167_0108_0002$$$::Every time I hear it, the swirling mud grows inside me.[lr]::
21455::$$$message_0167_0108_0003$$$::"Rrgh..."[lr]::
21456::$$$message_0167_0108_0004$$$::It's infuriating.[lr]::
21457::$$$message_0167_0108_0005$$$::I don't know what touched a nerve, exactly.[lr]::
21458::$$$message_0167_0108_0006$$$::Every time the mud stirs me to drive my fangs deeper...[lr]::
21459::$$$message_0167_0108_0007$$$::"Hrgh...!"[lr]::
21460::$$$message_0167_0108_0008$$$::...The incomprehensible, unbearable impulse seizes me.::
21461::$$$message_0167_0109_0000$$$::"Hyaah!?"[lr]::
21462::$$$message_0167_0109_0001$$$::My fangs suck magical energy from her neck.[lr]::
21463::$$$message_0167_0109_0002$$$::I feel an exquisite sensation of magical energy hydrating my parched throat and body.[lr]::
21464::$$$message_0167_0109_0003$$$::Not bad at all.::
21465::$$$message_0167_0110_0000$$$::"[line len=3], [line len=3], [line len=3]..."[lr]::
21466::$$$message_0167_0110_0001$$$::But the sound of her anguish only grows worse.[lr]::
21467::$$$message_0167_0110_0002$$$::I hear them both[line len=2]her voice, and the torrent of her magical energy flowing in.[lr]::
21468::$$$message_0167_0110_0003$$$::At this point, her limbs will burst open.::
21469::$$$message_0167_0111_0000$$$::"Ha... [wvl canskip=0 time=80][line len=3]Yes, calm yourself... [wvl canskip=0 time=100]It's okay... [wvl canskip=0 time=100]I can [wvl canskip=0 time=200]still...take it..."[lr]::
21470::$$$message_0167_0111_0001$$$::What is she talking about?[lr]::
21471::$$$message_0167_0111_0002$$$::I can't stand this.[lr]::
21472::$$$message_0167_0111_0003$$$::I want to kill her.[lr]::
21473::$$$message_0167_0111_0004$$$::"My thoughts are being torn apart; I want to tear you apart," I think furiously as my fangs tear into her.::
21474::$$$message_0167_0112_0000$$$::"Ha. Right, what pisses me off is..."[lr]::
21475::$$$message_0167_0112_0001$$$::This feeling.[lr]::
21476::$$$message_0167_0112_0002$$$::Her face, trying to suffer through the agony.::
21477::$$$message_0167_0113_0000$$$::"Ah, aaah...!?"[lr]::
21478::$$$message_0167_0113_0001$$$::As soon as I think about ending it, it ends.[lr]::
21479::$$$message_0167_0113_0002$$$::She was already at her limit from the very beginning.[lr]::
21480::$$$message_0167_0113_0003$$$::She offered up as much as I wanted.[lr]::
21481::$$$message_0167_0113_0004$$$::...It can't have been anything but agonizing.[lr]::
21482::$$$message_0167_0113_0005$$$::Why would she just accept it like that?::
21483::$$$message_0167_0114_0000$$$::"Ah... It's all right...take from me...as much as you want...!"[lr]::
21484::$$$message_0167_0114_0001$$$::My fury reaches a breaking point.[lr]::
21485::$$$message_0167_0114_0002$$$::I don't care how she feels about it. I touched her because I wanted to eat.::
21486::$$$message_0167_0115_0000$$$::But...she isn't afraid at all.[lr]::
21487::$$$message_0167_0115_0001$$$::She just accepts me.[lr]::
21488::$$$message_0167_0115_0002$$$::It's a gentle but not submissive gesture. She tries to protect me, not shut herself off from me.[lr]::
21489::$$$message_0167_0115_0003$$$::"Hrgh... Ah, guh...!"[lr]::
21490::$$$message_0167_0115_0004$$$::Fury turns into pain, as our arms and legs start to pulverize.::
21491::$$$message_0167_0116_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21492::$$$message_0167_0116_0001$$$::I lose my strength.[lr]::
21493::$$$message_0167_0116_0002$$$::Suddenly, I lose all interest, and my hunger for her magical energy ceases.::
21494::$$$message_0167_0117_0000$$$::"Ah... Eh...?"[lr]::
21495::$$$message_0167_0117_0001$$$::I loosen my hold on her somewhat.[lr]::
21496::$$$message_0167_0117_0002$$$::The magical energy hidden in her feverish, desperately controlled body is of superb quality. I can feel it.[lr]::
21497::$$$message_0167_0117_0003$$$::...It's heavenly. I'll never have a chance to eat something so delicious in my life.::
21498::$$$message_0167_0118_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21499::$$$message_0167_0118_0001$$$::I lift my fangs and pull away from her.[lr]::
21500::$$$message_0167_0118_0002$$$::I really think I'm gonna puke.[lr]::
21501::$$$message_0167_0118_0003$$$::Urges still smoldering, still feeling unsatisfied, I fight down the venom welling up within me.::
21502::$$$message_0167_0119_0000$$$::"Ah... Shirou Emiya...? Are you finished...?"[lr]::
21503::$$$message_0167_0119_0001$$$::Free from her penance, she gives me a look of pure relief.[lr]::
21504::$$$message_0167_0119_0002$$$::Her breathing slows bit by bit.::
21505::$$$message_0167_0120_0000$$$::Good. This is good, so why did I...[lr]::
21506::$$$message_0167_0120_0001$$$::All I wanted to do was eat her.[lr]::
21507::$$$message_0167_0120_0002$$$::Her pain didn't matter.[lr]::
21508::$$$message_0167_0120_0003$$$::Of course she'd feel relieved that it's over. So, why?::
21509::$$$message_0167_0121_0000$$$::"Thank goodness. Somehow..."[lr]::
21510::$$$message_0167_0121_0001$$$::Is she trying to say that she held out, somehow?[lr]::
21511::$$$message_0167_0121_0002$$$::She looks around, her limbs unmoving.[lr]::
21512::$$$message_0167_0121_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
21513::$$$message_0167_0121_0004$$$::I don't know what it means.[lr]::
21514::$$$message_0167_0121_0005$$$::Her pitiful eyes take in the room around us, and...::
21515::$$$message_0167_0122_0000$$$::"Um...are you all right...?"[lr]::
21516::$$$message_0167_0122_0001$$$::...She worries about someone who doesn't matter.::
21517::$$$message_0167_0123_0000$$$::"Tch. What the hell?"[lr]::
21518::$$$message_0167_0123_0001$$$::It's like I'm struck by lightning.[lr]::
21519::$$$message_0167_0123_0002$$$::Thunderous anger threatens to split me from head to toe.[lr]::
21520::$$$message_0167_0123_0003$$$::I grit my teeth. Something terrible and hot balls up in my chest, and I feel as if I'm about to vomit.::
21521::$$$message_0167_0124_0000$$$::"...I mean, you were considerate of me.[lr]::
21522::$$$message_0167_0124_0001$$$::...You felt the same pain that I did... Just as I tried to control the possession, you were trying to maintain your self as Shirou Emiya..."::
21523::$$$message_0167_0125_0000$$$::Golden eyes watch me hazily.[lr]::
21524::$$$message_0167_0125_0001$$$::The eyes of an invalid.[lr]::
21525::$$$message_0167_0125_0002$$$::Like her arms and legs, they're wrecked and unusable.[lr]::
21526::$$$message_0167_0125_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
21527::$$$message_0167_0125_0004$$$::All along...[lr]::
21528::$$$message_0167_0125_0005$$$::she was only afraid that she wouldn't be able to see me anymore.::
21529::$$$message_0167_0126_0000$$$::That's what truly defines this woman: [lr]::
21530::$$$message_0167_0126_0001$$$::the devotion to throw herself onto the witch's pyre,[lr]::
21531::$$$message_0167_0126_0002$$$::and unconditional benevolence for others, no matter what brutality she faces.[lr]::
21532::$$$message_0167_0126_0003$$$::A white flower. Meat. A gleaming, wet slug.[lr]::
21533::$$$message_0167_0126_0004$$$::   There's nothing beautiful about her at all.::
21534::$$$message_0167_0127_0000$$$::"Hey. Your body can't take any more, can it?"[lr]::
21535::$$$message_0167_0127_0001$$$::My cheeks itch.[lr]::
21536::$$$message_0167_0127_0002$$$::I scratch at my cheekbone with my claws.[lr]::
21537::$$$message_0167_0127_0003$$$::"...Yes. I don't think I can bear any more, so... I'm glad I didn't hurt you too badly."[lr]::
21538::$$$message_0167_0127_0004$$$::It's too late for that.[lr]::
21539::$$$message_0167_0127_0005$$$::You should've skewered me before you realized that.::
21540::$$$message_0167_0128_0000$$$::"Sorry, but I'm just getting started. Everything so far was just Shirou Emiya's lust."[lr]::
21541::$$$message_0167_0128_0001$$$::"Eh?"[lr]::
21542::$$$message_0167_0128_0002$$$::I drag my claws from my cheek, like pulling off a mask.[lr]::
21543::$$$message_0167_0128_0003$$$::Never mind breaking the rules; I abandon the game altogether.[lr]::
21544::$$$message_0167_0128_0004$$$::Just for now, I'll reject who I am.::
21545::$$$message_0167_0129_0000$$$::"Ngh, huh!?"[lr]::
21546::$$$message_0167_0129_0001$$$::Her body spasms.[lr]::
21547::$$$message_0167_0129_0002$$$::The body that goes into a possession state whenever demons are nearby.::
21548::$$$message_0167_0130_0000$$$::"N-no...![lr]::
21549::$$$message_0167_0130_0001$$$::S-stop it! I can't...take it...!"[lr]::
21550::$$$message_0167_0130_0002$$$::She's more scared than I've ever seen her.[lr]::
21551::$$$message_0167_0130_0003$$$::She finally cares about her own body, not someone else's.::
21552::$$$message_0167_0131_0000$$$::"Ah...ngh...!"[lr]::
21553::$$$message_0167_0131_0001$$$::I embrace her body.[lr]::
21554::$$$message_0167_0131_0002$$$::I can feel the fear in it, unlike before.[lr]::
21555::$$$message_0167_0131_0003$$$::I clutch her pale back as hard as I can.::
21556::$$$message_0167_0132_0000$$$::"Guh...! Why? If you do this, you'll..."[lr]::
21557::$$$message_0167_0132_0001$$$::"Worry about yourself, first. This next part is gonna be different. Don't you become possessed.[lr]::
21558::$$$message_0167_0132_0002$$$::Hang in there until you die..."[lr]::
21559::$$$message_0167_0132_0003$$$::I hope she stays as delicate as she is.::
21560::$$$message_0167_0133_0000$$$::"!!![wvl][line len=3]Ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=200]Stop, pulling me, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]I'm going crazy... It'll kill you... Hurry, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]let go...of me...!"[lr]::
21561::$$$message_0167_0133_0001$$$::She stiffens, but I don't care.[lr]::
21562::$$$message_0167_0133_0002$$$::I bite into her neck again.::
21563::$$$message_0167_0134_0000$$$::"Hnngh! No, you can't...!"[lr]::
21564::$$$message_0167_0134_0001$$$::"RRRGH!"[lr]::
21565::$$$message_0167_0134_0002$$$::Electricity jolts through me.[lr]::
21566::$$$message_0167_0134_0003$$$::It isn't the stimulation of her magical energy.[lr]::
21567::$$$message_0167_0134_0004$$$::It's the cutting pain of some part of me being erased by her.::
21568::$$$message_0167_0135_0000$$$::"Ha... Yeah, this is how it's gotta be."[lr]::
21569::$$$message_0167_0135_0001$$$::"Ah... Eh...?"[lr]::
21570::$$$message_0167_0135_0002$$$::I need more stimulation.[lr]::
21571::$$$message_0167_0135_0003$$$::As I tear into her, the exorcist takes in a part of me.[lr]::
21572::$$$message_0167_0135_0004$$$::We trade blows. Either our insides will run out, or leak out. The only question is which happens first.[lr]::
21573::$$$message_0167_0135_0005$$$::Take as much as you want. If taking so much means your feminine body won't collapse, that's enough.::
21574::$$$message_0167_0136_0000$$$::"...! No...! I-it hurts...it's tearing me apart...!"[lr]::
21575::$$$message_0167_0136_0001$$$::My breath is ragged now, too.[lr]::
21576::$$$message_0167_0136_0002$$$::Sparks fly in my brain.[lr]::
21577::$$$message_0167_0136_0003$$$::My skull cracks each time I suck in her magical energy.[lr]::
21578::$$$message_0167_0136_0004$$$::Every part of me that touches her body feels like it's being stabbed by a thousand ice picks.::
21579::$$$message_0167_0137_0000$$$::"You're tearing...me...apart...!"[lr]::
21580::$$$message_0167_0137_0001$$$::"Rrgh..."[lr]::
21581::$$$message_0167_0137_0002$$$::I feel only pain.[lr]::
21582::$$$message_0167_0137_0003$$$::I should feel nourished by the magical energy, but it isn't enough.[lr]::
21583::$$$message_0167_0137_0004$$$::I don't care. I'll take anything that makes my brain feel something.[lr]::
21584::$$$message_0167_0137_0005$$$::"No... Aargh, aah, ah...!"[lr]::
21585::$$$message_0167_0137_0006$$$::Led on by the her voice, torment twists my retinas.::
21586::$$$message_0167_0138_0000$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
21587::$$$message_0167_0138_0001$$$::I want to hear more.[lr]::
21588::$$$message_0167_0138_0002$$$::Her screams are exquisite. I love it.[lr]::
21589::$$$message_0167_0138_0003$$$::The pain of being torn apart is terrible, and I don't think the drooling will stop.::
21590::$$$message_0167_0139_0000$$$::"Please...your mind...will collapse[line len=2]I don't know, I don't know this...!"[lr]::
21591::$$$message_0167_0139_0001$$$::Her begging backfires.[lr]::
21592::$$$message_0167_0139_0002$$$::Why/Every time/I hear her pleas/Why/I take even more magical energy/I still/I want to take my anger out on her.::
21593::$$$message_0167_0140_0000$$$::The white flower cries in anguish, fighting my embrace.[lr]::
21594::$$$message_0167_0140_0001$$$::In pain, in denial, she shakes her head, placing her hands on my chest in response.[lr]::
21595::$$$message_0167_0140_0002$$$::"Ngh, ah...! Aah, I'm...scared, it's like you're, nibbling me from the inside...!"[lr]::
21596::$$$message_0167_0140_0003$$$::I start to lose my balance.[lr]::
21597::$$$message_0167_0140_0004$$$::The act brought only pain, but now another sensation blends into it.::
21598::$$$message_0167_0141_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21599::$$$message_0167_0141_0001$$$::Now, the white flower is red-hot.[lr]::
21600::$$$message_0167_0141_0002$$$::Secreted sensation mixes with dripping sweat, filling us both.::
21601::$$$message_0167_0142_0000$$$::"Haah, haah, ah...!"[lr]::
21602::$$$message_0167_0142_0001$$$::She struggles to contain the demon with an emotion other than fear.[lr]::
21603::$$$message_0167_0142_0002$$$::Her back arches and wriggles at the sensation of having her magical energy utterly hollowed out.[lr]::
21604::$$$message_0167_0142_0003$$$::She moans sweetly at the feeling of canines digging into her, of having her magical energy violently plundered.::
21605::$$$message_0167_0143_0000$$$::"Keep...going...I can take...a little more..."[lr]::
21606::$$$message_0167_0143_0001$$$::I feel numb.[lr]::
21607::$$$message_0167_0143_0002$$$::Magical energy surges as she reacts, but not like the first time.[lr]::
21608::$$$message_0167_0143_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
21609::$$$message_0167_0143_0004$$$::I smirk. It isn't fun unless it's like this. This isn't a loving embrace at all. All I want are her screams. My sadism won't be satisfied unless she struggles for her life.::
21610::$$$message_0167_0144_0000$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
21611::$$$message_0167_0144_0001$$$::Ahh... I feel like I could grow new fangs.[lr]::
21612::$$$message_0167_0144_0002$$$::Shuddering at the teeth piercing her, she offers up her magical energy, all the while spasming in her desperate attempt to discharge me.[lr]::
21613::$$$message_0167_0144_0003$$$::"Nngh...!"[lr]::
21614::$$$message_0167_0144_0004$$$::Every time she does, her body melts.[lr]::
21615::$$$message_0167_0144_0005$$$::Every time I absorb magical energy, she stirs. Each and every move her muscles make...::
21616::$$$message_0167_0145_0000$$$::"Aah...it hurts...it hurts...it hurts, it hurts...it hurts so much..."[lr]::
21617::$$$message_0167_0145_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
21618::$$$message_0167_0145_0002$$$::My pain becomes harder to perceive.[lr]::
21619::$$$message_0167_0145_0003$$$::The only thing moving me now is my desire to taste this woman.::
21620::$$$message_0167_0146_0000$$$::"No, you can't... You should stop now... I don't know what'll happen...next...!"[lr]::
21621::$$$message_0167_0146_0001$$$::Like I care.[lr]::
21622::$$$message_0167_0146_0002$$$::You could stop me anytime you wanted. To begin with...[lr]::
21623::$$$message_0167_0146_0003$$$::"What are you yammering on about, exorcist? Isn't this what it means to be monster bait?"[lr]::
21624::$$$message_0167_0146_0004$$$::"Ah... Aaaah!?"::
21625::$$$message_0167_0147_0000$$$::   I drive my fangs into her neck even harder than before,[lr]::
21626::$$$message_0167_0147_0001$$$::all while trembling at her resistance.[lr]::
21627::$$$message_0167_0147_0002$$$::   I raise my claws, not bothering to hide my boiling hatred.[lr]::
21628::$$$message_0167_0147_0003$$$::I can't tell if I'm embracing her or breaking a flower off at the stem.[lr]::
21629::$$$message_0167_0147_0004$$$::   I give myself over to my five distorted senses and devour the magical energy.[lr]::
21630::$$$message_0167_0147_0005$$$::The surrounding sensations melt into me, like a song.::
21631::$$$message_0167_0148_0000$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
21632::$$$message_0167_0148_0001$$$::The pain is gone.[lr]::
21633::$$$message_0167_0148_0002$$$::My fangs plunge into her, over and over.[lr]::
21634::$$$message_0167_0148_0003$$$::"Haah... Haah, ah, aaah...!"[lr]::
21635::$$$message_0167_0148_0004$$$::Has she gone over the edge before me?[lr]::
21636::$$$message_0167_0148_0005$$$::She's reacting only to the pain of being pushed down now, not the possession.::
21637::$$$message_0167_0149_0000$$$::"No... Stop, my bones are on fire, more, do it harder...!"[lr]::
21638::$$$message_0167_0149_0001$$$::"                "[lr]::
21639::$$$message_0167_0149_0002$$$::I drink in the pool of magical energy. My throat growls.[lr]::
21640::$$$message_0167_0149_0003$$$::She goes as stiff as a board under the assault of countless sensations.[lr]::
21641::$$$message_0167_0149_0004$$$::I gulp. I swallow.[lr]::
21642::$$$message_0167_0149_0005$$$::I feel the fragments of her soul racing through my body.::
21643::$$$message_0167_0150_0000$$$::"Aah, aaah, it, it hurts, A...ra, you're going to...!"[lr]::
21644::$$$message_0167_0150_0001$$$::That works out for me. If it's just a hand or two mutating, all I need to do is chew and swallow.[lr]::
21645::$$$message_0167_0150_0002$$$::If a demon's going to spring out from her stomach, I'll bury my face in my meal and gorge myself so she stays looking human.::
21646::$$$message_0167_0151_0000$$$::"Ah...aah, aaahhh..."[lr]::
21647::$$$message_0167_0151_0001$$$::Her body's on the verge of total collapse.[lr]::
21648::$$$message_0167_0151_0002$$$::My fangs attack her faster than her body can change from the inside.[lr]::
21649::$$$message_0167_0151_0003$$$::I can't hold it back.[lr]::
21650::$$$message_0167_0151_0004$$$::I can't stop this urge I barely understand.[lr]::
21651::$$$message_0167_0151_0005$$$::I open my mouth to devour not just her magical energy, but her flesh[line len=2]::
21652::$$$message_0167_0152_0000$$$::"Ngh...!"[lr]::
21653::$$$message_0167_0152_0001$$$::And in her stupor,[lr]::
21654::$$$message_0167_0152_0002$$$::terrified, she brings my mind back to life.::
21655::$$$message_0167_0153_0000$$$::"Ha... [wvl canskip=0 time=100]God...[wvl canskip=0 time=50]dammit."[lr]::
21656::$$$message_0167_0153_0001$$$::At the last possible second, I realize it.[lr]::
21657::$$$message_0167_0153_0002$$$::...It's no big deal.[lr]::
21658::$$$message_0167_0153_0003$$$::I did it in the heat of the moment... But I just wanted her, earnestly.::
21659::$$$message_0167_0154_0000$$$::"It's okay... I won't stop you anymore."[lr]::
21660::$$$message_0167_0154_0001$$$::I can't share that emotion.[lr]::
21661::$$$message_0167_0154_0002$$$::We're touching each other, but our emotions alone differ.[lr]::
21662::$$$message_0167_0154_0003$$$::"Let our flesh melt together... Let us become one..."[lr]::
21663::$$$message_0167_0154_0004$$$::The feeling of eating one another. A form of passion and agreement, accompanied by sensations that can't possibly be the same.::
21664::$$$message_0167_0155_0000$$$::"Ah... It hurts...Aŋra..."[lr]::
21665::$$$message_0167_0155_0001$$$::"                "[lr]::
21666::$$$message_0167_0155_0002$$$::She's at her limit.[lr]::
21667::$$$message_0167_0155_0003$$$::I'm at my limit.[lr]::
21668::$$$message_0167_0155_0004$$$::Finally, I can see a dead end to my voracious hunger for magical energy.[lr]::
21669::$$$message_0167_0155_0005$$$::"Mmgh, ah...!"::
21670::$$$message_0167_0156_0000$$$::I lower my fangs to her neck again, hoping for one last bite.[lr]::
21671::$$$message_0167_0156_0001$$$::It flows. It spills. Her last drops of magical energy, her very life itself, starts to enter me...[lr]::
21672::$$$message_0167_0156_0002$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
21673::$$$message_0167_0156_0003$$$::I back away from her body, just before I swallow.[lr]::
21674::$$$message_0167_0156_0004$$$::That's the right choice. She still has an important job to do. I can't consume her completely.::
21675::$$$message_0167_0157_0000$$$::"Ha... Ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=100]Why, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]Aŋra [wvl canskip=0 time=100]Mainiiu...?"[lr]::
21676::$$$message_0167_0157_0001$$$::What a dumb question.[lr]::
21677::$$$message_0167_0157_0002$$$::The first thing I should've realized conveniently slipped my mind.[lr]::
21678::$$$message_0167_0157_0003$$$::                                [font italic=true]"Don't you find anything beautiful...?"[font italic=false][lr]::
21679::$$$message_0167_0157_0004$$$::Obviously.[lr]::
21680::$$$message_0167_0157_0005$$$::Either way, I shouldn't care.[lr]::
21681::$$$message_0167_0157_0006$$$::Once I embrace passion, all I can do is kill.::
21682::$$$message_0167_0158_0000$$$::The temperature cools.[lr]::
21683::$$$message_0167_0158_0001$$$::My meal finished, I hurry to put on my shell again.[lr]::
21684::$$$message_0167_0158_0002$$$::Fortunately, I didn't pass the point of no return, so the repair won't take long.::
21685::$$$message_0167_0159_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21686::$$$message_0167_0159_0001$$$::Caren apparently managed to avoid fatal damage too, since she's looking at me again with her usual dour expression.::
21687::$$$message_0167_0160_0000$$$::"...If you have any excuses, I'll hear them out.[lr]::
21688::$$$message_0167_0160_0001$$$::Just what in the world were you thinking?"[lr]::
21689::$$$message_0167_0160_0002$$$::"I wasn't. I just did what I felt like in the moment. Deed's done, so now I can go home."::
21690::$$$message_0167_0161_0000$$$::She exudes a positively murderous aura.[lr]::
21691::$$$message_0167_0161_0001$$$::If she had a knife, she'd definitely stab me with it.[lr]::
21692::$$$message_0167_0161_0002$$$::Which is my cue to make a quick exit.::
21693::$$$message_0167_0162_0000$$$::"Sometimes dogs bite their owners. Shit happens.[lr]::
21694::$$$message_0167_0162_0001$$$::Either way, this is the last time. I won't get involved with you anymore, so think of it as a parting gift from me."[lr]::
21695::$$$message_0167_0162_0002$$$::I leave the stone chamber.[lr]::
21696::$$$message_0167_0162_0003$$$::I'd better tuck my tail and run before she rips my disguise off.::
21697::$$$message_0167_0163_0000$$$::"Hold it. That isn't an excuse.[lr]::
21698::$$$message_0167_0163_0001$$$::...I'll rephrase my question. Why did you stop?[lr]::
21699::$$$message_0167_0163_0002$$$::I thought you would eat me whole."[lr]::
21700::$$$message_0167_0163_0003$$$::"Gah, [font italic=true]that's[font italic=false] what you're hung up on!?[lr]::
21701::$$$message_0167_0163_0004$$$::Unfortunately, I have no memory of any actions I may or may not have taken."[lr]::
21702::$$$message_0167_0163_0005$$$::"What a terrible evasion... I was truly a fool to even ask."::
21703::$$$message_0167_0164_0000$$$::She steps aside, clearly done with me.[lr]::
21704::$$$message_0167_0164_0001$$$::...Now, then.[lr]::
21705::$$$message_0167_0164_0002$$$::Before  she  changes  her  mind  and  punishes  me,[r]                                                                                     I'd  better  book  it,[lr]::
21706::$$$message_0167_0164_0003$$$::and never see her again.::
21707::$$$message_0167_0165_0000$$$::"...Oh. What about you? What did [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] have in mind?"[lr]::
21708::$$$message_0167_0165_0001$$$::A simple question.[lr]::
21709::$$$message_0167_0165_0002$$$::"...Nothing in particular."[lr]::
21710::$$$message_0167_0165_0003$$$::A calm answer.[lr]::
21711::$$$message_0167_0165_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
21712::$$$message_0167_0165_0005$$$::I start walking again toward the stairs.[lr]::
21713::$$$message_0167_0165_0006$$$::And thus, our last chance encounter ends.::
21714::$$$message_0167_0166_0000$$$::"Bye. You felt pretty good, by the way."[lr]::
21715::$$$message_0167_0166_0001$$$::"Why, thank you. Repent your sins, you beast."::
21716::$$$message_0167_0167_0000$$$::...The earthly signpost disappears.[lr]::
21717::$$$message_0167_0167_0001$$$::The version of me that visits this place won't appear ever again.::
921287::$$$message_9167_0071_0005$$$::I'll take anything. Right now, it's time to lust for the prey in front of me.[r]::

